# Desist: "Destroy all artifacts and enchantments." Destroying can be regenerated (CR 701.19): with Desist on the stack Bot1
# sacrifices Welding Jar to give its untapped Mox Jet a regeneration shield. Desist destroys every other artifact - the Moxen
# and Black Lotus spent on it, which are gone for good - but Mox Jet is not destroyed: it is tapped instead (CR 701.19c), and
# it stays tapped though it was untapped when Desist was cast. Welding Jar went to the graveyard as a cost.

